<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>When you follow, as you follow;</l><l>Take the blood, and call His name;</l><l>Much assurance He will give you,</l><l>And the enemy you’ll shame.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>When they speak, as they are speaking,</l><l>Open wide your heart to them,</l><l>Thus the Word of God receiving,</l><l>Word of God, and not of men.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Now the Word of God is running,</l><l>Running fast, and running free.</l><l>This is how the Lord is moving,</l><l>In His own recovery.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>O be glad, rejoice, dear brothers,</l><l>For the coming wedding day.</l><l>Then the Bride will be made ready—</l><l>Those who followed all the way.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
